<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</title>
<headline>Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for export of a 100-pound (45.36 kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean coffee, effective from June 5 to June 11, 1997.</p>
<p>	 Washed arabic....................$ 255.38</p>
<p>	 Natural arabic...................$ 245.84</p>
<p>	 Robust natural...................$  89.84</p>
<p>	 Roasted and/or ground............$ 199.73</p>
</text>
